OL,3,AFrom scooters to shampoo - the people
OL,4,Asaving hundreds from dumpster diving
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarryl Baker was shocked to see piles
OL,7,Fof clothes dumped beside the recycling
OL,8,Fbins outside her local supermarket.
OL,10,FOn several trips to the dumpsters she
OL,11,Fhas also found a host of other items,
OL,12,Fsuch as "a perfectly decent" Ikea
OL,13,Fpicture frame and children's scooters.
OL,15,FAlways on the lookout for ways to save
OL,16,Fmoney and appalled by the waste, the
OL,17,Fthrifty mother-of-two from north London
OL,18,Fasked supermarket staff if she could
OL,19,Ftake some of it.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
