OL,3,AFrom scooters to shampoo - the people
OL,4,Asaving hundreds from dumpster diving
OL,5,
OL,6,FPermission granted, "I got my children
OL,7,Fentire new wardrobes," says Darryl, 39,
OL,8,Fadding that she's stuff put away for
OL,9,Fyears to come.
